From c8727bb66f1443e55b8dd4ad2d9fcfd3edd8d951 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jsnd <ros2kil105@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 13:35:59 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Stabilise integrated MPC (OSQP lock-up), 100 Hz, latched
 E-stop, speed profiles

- integrated_mpc: constant constraint matrix, no per-solve sparse build or np.r_,
  dual warm start, continue from OSQP's last iterate after a budget miss
- Controller: on MPC STOP, steering returns to 0 at the rate limit instead of being held
- mpc_car.yaml: 100 Hz, max_iter 4000 (time limit 4 ms, deadline 8 ms), 1.0 m/s base;
  profiles mpc_profile_lowspeed.yaml (1.0) / mpc_profile_exp2mps.yaml (2.0)
- simple_mux safety_mode (default off; on for controller:=mpc): latched E-stop on A/LB/
  joy loss/topic, no manual drive, restart via /simple_mux/reset_estop, RB hold-to-run
- race.launch: mpc_profile, mpc_rate_hz, safety_mode, mux_rate_hz args

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
